{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10111050","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10111050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1011105001:0":{"text":"이 난민들은 그저 잠시 머무르면서 살 길을 찾으려는 것 뿐이라고!","source_cn":"这些难民只想暂住，寻找求生之道而已！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAE2F435673EA033","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1011105002:0":{"text":"와일더스가 사정없이 내쫓다니, 정말 말도 안되는 일이야!","source_cn":"绿裔竟然毫不留情下令驱赶，令人不齿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF31093CCBB30A27D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011105003:0":{"text":"오해에요, 콜린 형님, 분명 오해일 거예요! 저희 종족이 이런 일을 했을리가 없다고요!","source_cn":"误会，科林老兄，这一定是误会！我的族人绝不会做出这种事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0132FA70EEC083FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:科林":{"text":"콜린","source":"科林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}